# Named arg type checking: unknown param name emits type-checker warning
# Multi-document form ensures $f is fully resolved before check_call inspects it.
# The type checker warns about the unknown named argument (CALL-MONO path).
[f: [fn [x@Int y@Int] [call $+ $x $y]]]
---
[result: [call $f 42 z: 999]]
=== warn
unknown named argument: function has no parameter named 'z'
=== error
[E002] undefined variable: f
